rple_Worm_Poison_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Purple_Worm_Poison_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Purple_Worm_Poison_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Purple_Worm_Poison_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Purple_Worm_Poison_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Purple_Worm_Poison_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Purple Worm Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Purple_Worm_Poison_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Purple_Worm_Poison_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Purple_Worm_Poison_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Purple_Worm_Poison\" title=\"Purple Worm Poison\">Purple Worm Poison</a> - <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Coated_in_Purple_Worm_Toxin_(Condition)\" title=\"Coated in Purple Worm Toxin (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/COAT_Purple_Worm_Toxin_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-COAT_Purple_Worm_Toxin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/COAT_Purple_Worm_Toxin_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-COAT_Purple_Worm_Toxin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/COAT_Purple_Worm_Toxin_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-COAT_Purple_Worm_Toxin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Coated in Purple Worm Toxin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/COAT_Purple_Worm_Toxin_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-COAT_Purple_Worm_Toxin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/COAT_Purple_Worm_Toxin_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Coated_in_Purple_Worm_Toxin_(Condition)\" title=\"Coated in Purple Worm Toxin (Condition)\">Coated in Purple Worm Toxin</a> for 10 turns</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Water_(surface)\" title=\"Water (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Water_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Water_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Water_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Water_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Water_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Water_(surface)\" title=\"Water (surface)\">Water</a> - Washes off existing coating</li></ul></li>\n<li>Any other surface such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Water\" title=\"Electrified Water\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Electrified Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Water\" title=\"Electrified Water\">Electrified Water</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Holy_Fire\" title=\"Holy Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Holy_Fire_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Holy_Fire_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Holy_Fire_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Holy_Fire_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Holy_Fire_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Holy_Fire_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Holy Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Holy_Fire_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Holy_Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Holy_Fire_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Holy_Fire\" title=\"Holy Fire\">Holy Fire</a> are not dippable.</li>\n<li>Despite the tooltip description stating you can use the Dip ability to \"alter the surface\", this does not appear to be possible with any surfaces currently implemented.</li>\n<li>The effect of dipping is similar to <a href=\"/wiki/Coatings\" title=\"Coatings\">Coatings</a> and mutually exclusive with them.</li>\n<li>Some <a href=\"/wiki/Coatings\" title=\"Coatings\">Coatings</a> can be thrown on the ground to make a <a href=\"/wiki/Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surface\">surface</a>. This surface will persist between <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rests</a>\n<ul><li>Dipping your weapon in the surface will give the coating effect.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Weapons can be dipped into any object with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a> condition, including torches, candles, and burning party members. A character can carry burning objects such as torches, and drop them on the ground (which does not spend actions or bonus actions) just before dipping.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Weapons can be dipped into a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Sphere\" title=\"Flaming Sphere\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Flaming_Sphere.png/20px-Portrait_Flaming_Sphere.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Flaming_Sphere.png/30px-Portrait_Flaming_Sphere.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Flaming_Sphere.png/40px-Portrait_Flaming_Sphere.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flaming Sphere\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Flaming_Sphere.png/20px-Portrait_Flaming_Sphere.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Portrait_Flaming_Sphere.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Sphere\" title=\"Flaming Sphere\">Flaming Sphere</a> <i>only</i> if it was created by a non-upcasted <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Sphere\" title=\"Flaming Sphere\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp/20px-Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp/30px-Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp/40px-Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flaming Sphere\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp/20px-Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Flaming_Sphere_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Sphere\" title=\"Flaming Sphere\">Flaming Sphere</a> spell.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034252\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.176 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.190 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9089/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 135867/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 60976/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 39/1000\nLua time usage: 0.036/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1644278/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  158.874      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%  158.874      1 -total\n 92.07%  146.276     86 Template:Trim\n 25.11%   39.896     26 Template:Icon_text\n 23.84%   37.883     24 Template:Icon_link\n 21.23%   33.729      5 Template:Condition\n 20.98%   33.325      9 Template:Area\n 13.75%   21.851      6 Template:Cond\n  9.06%   14.389      9 Template:Area_inline/format\n  8.46%   13.442      8 Template:Condition_inline/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:1906-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715034252 and revision id 383379. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}